message: "If you use ConfigReach in research or engineering evaluation, please cite this software and the version you used."
title: "ConfigReach"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Singla"
    given-names: "Saurav"
version: "0.9.4"
date-released: "2026-09-30"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/sauravsingla/ConfigReach"
repository: "https://zenodo.org/records/23038726"
url: "https://github.com/sauravsingla/ConfigReach"
abstract: >-
  ConfigReach is a deterministic, CPU-only configuration coverage analyzer for
  software repositories. It identifies environment variables, feature flags,
  configuration declarations, CLI options and configuration-dependent states,
  then maps them to test or runtime evidence.
keywords:
  - configuration coverage
  - configuration testing
  - environment variables
  - feature flags
  - static analysis
  - software testing
  - continuous integration
